/* Fixed UTC offset for AGENT_TIMEZONE ("CST-8" == UTC+8).
 * NuttX romfs lacks zoneinfo for POSIX TZ strings, so localtime_r/
 * mktime are deliberately avoided; we apply the offset manually and
